WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.840
Wall Street Kid, where life, love, and money all depend on how well you play the game.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:30.440
And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.480
I'm Mike. I'm Sean.

00:00:32.820 --> 00:00:33.780
And I'm Joe.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:39.340
A good game always starts off with your uncle's lawyer telling you he died.

