Now, here's the thing about your wife.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.440
I think she's your wife.

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.640
She becomes your wife.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:30.480
If you're playing the game right, she'll become your wife.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:31.860
Oh, I see. Yeah, you're just dating.

