Okay. So I mean, in the grand scheme of things, like, you know, the things that she's asking for, she's like, oh, I want a dog.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.860
Or like, oh, I want like a new sound system.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.860
Like, if you're playing the game right, it's going to be negligible.

00:04:43.180 --> 00:04:45.860
So, you know, you signed up for this.

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:47.240
