00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.120
Priscilla is her name. Priscilla, the prima donna.

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.520
So you knew this.

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:09.280
That's her last name. The prima donna.

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:12.360
I love that.

00:05:12.480 --> 00:05:13.540
That's her last name.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:14.580
The prima donna.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:18.340
But yeah, she also, you know, she likes picnics.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.260
