Okay, so let's just define.

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:35.900
Yeah, you go shopping, but you steal most of it.

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:42.140
Yeah. So when you're playing this game, you basically just buy and sell stock.

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.840
Like these are the things that you do in the game.

00:05:44.980 --> 00:05:46.220
You buy and you sell stock.

00:05:46.500 --> 00:05:48.880
Stock prices don't move intraday.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:58.500
This is, you're, you may have a computer, but we're in like the 1950s in terms of how stocks are priced.

