To go do things during the day.

00:06:13.500 --> 00:06:20.380
And I don't really know if there's any actual, aside from like doing it once in a while, I don't know what the benefit is.

00:06:20.380 --> 00:06:24.760
Well, I think the, I think the benefit is, is, is that you don't get a negative.

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:29.620
Yeah. Cause I have a couple of times gotten like, your doctor says you're really not healthy.

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.660
Are you exercising enough?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:32.500
And I'm like, Oh no, I forgot to go hiking this week.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.420
So I'm assuming that if you also, on a Thursday too.

00:06:36.680 --> 00:06:38.020
