00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:41.440
Yeah. Like I forgot to go hiking on like a specific weekday.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.880
Like I couldn't wait for the weekend. Well, I thought you had to just go hiking first thing in the morning because it takes like eight hours.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.140
Yeah. It takes the whole time.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.920
Right. Exactly. But this is just like describing this.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:51.660
