00:11:27.050 --> 00:11:30.890
I think that one, it's not as telegraphed as you're describing.

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:36.810
It's still like nudging you towards a certain like, uh, stock type.

00:11:37.270 --> 00:11:42.250
And then the ones within that type will do better or maybe not as better.

