Talk to Connie.

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:55.170
She'll fucking tell you what to do and not to do.

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:56.910
Like that's the actual information.

00:11:56.910 --> 00:12:03.650
Cause like when you're on the newspaper, it's only telling you what happened yesterday and that may or may not continue.

00:12:03.930 --> 00:12:10.310
It's like, if you pick something that's described in the newspaper from yesterday, it's more likely than not to be good.

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:11.850
It just might not be the best.

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:15.350
But I thought that groups, the groups didn't change throughout the week.

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:18.790
Like I thought if they told you blue chip is good, it's good for the week.

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:22.530
I never had that kind of cycle change from a Monday to Friday.

00:12:24.170 --> 00:12:29.610
Oh, I don't, I guess like I just, I kept changing the stock that I had like a hundred percent.

00:12:29.830 --> 00:12:31.530
