00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:08.470
I thought maybe it would do that.

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:15.790
Uh, but it wasn't and it goes so far in the opposite direction where like in this universe, there's no such thing as a mortgage.

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:22.690
Like you have to buy that house, which is like your third of the game, like milestone.

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:30.350
